From 132db6a0efdfa6891a8bff7e58d8e4d8c1f8919d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Senior Dev Auditor <audit@massbattle.local>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 13:56:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/9] phase2-audit: remove the permanently-failing T2.9 stub;
 guard-move T2.8 test (C-6, C-3)

C-6: FPerfGate2Skeleton ('Battle.Perf.Gate2') unconditionally AddError'd
and returned false -- a placeholder that task 9's REAL gate (the
Battle.Combat.PerfStress fixture + measured TallyMs/AssignMs vs the
checked-in baseline) superseded but never deleted. It silently fails any
run matching the Battle.Perf filter forever. Deleted; a comment records
where the actual gate lives. C-7 was re-verified during this pass and
needed no change: TallyProcessor's PairQuery already carries the
FDeadTag None guard (pattern-consistent).

C-3: FDeterminismTwoRun ('Battle.Func.DeterminismTwoRun', the T2.8 gate)
was registered AFTER the file's WITH_DEV_AUTOMATION_TESTS #endif -- the
only test in the file outside the guard. Moved inside so the file's
editor-only macro discipline holds uniformly. No behavior change in any
test configuration that compiles this module.
---
 .../Private/MassBattleCombatTests.cpp         | 20 +++++--------------
 .../Private/MassBattleFuncTestHarness.cpp     |  4 ++--
 2 files changed, 7 insertions(+), 17 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Plugins/MassBattle/Source/MassBattleTest/Private/MassBattleCombatTests.cpp b/Plugins/MassBattle/Source/MassBattleTest/Private/MassBattleCombatTests.cpp
index b0d0d3a..38c98ae 100644
--- a/Plugins/MassBattle/Source/MassBattleTest/Private/MassBattleCombatTests.cpp
+++ b/Plugins/MassBattle/Source/MassBattleTest/Private/MassBattleCombatTests.cpp
@@ -1059,23 +1059,13 @@ bool FTallyAssign::RunTest(const FString& Parameters)
 // ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
 
 // ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-// T2.9 perf gate placeholder (task 9): the pairing pass budget.
-// Runs under the Battle.Perf filter (nightly/Gauntlet territory per B.0) --
-// matched by neither CI tier's filter string, so it changes no tier's count.
+// T2.9 perf gate: shipped by task 9 as the Battle.Combat.PerfStress fixture +
+// the measured AssignMs/TallyMs metrics against the checked-in baseline JSON.
+// (The permanently-failing Battle.Perf.Gate2 skeleton that preceded it was
+// removed by the 2026-10-28 audit: it failed any run matching Battle.Perf
+// forever, by design of nothing -- the gate had already landed.)
 // ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
 
-IMPLEMENT_SIMPLE_AUTOMATION_TEST(FPerfGate2Skeleton,
-	"Battle.Perf.Gate2",
-	(EAutomationTestFlags::ClientContext | EAutomationTestFlags::ProductFilter))
-
-bool FPerfGate2Skeleton::RunTest(const FString& Parameters)
-{
-	// T2.9 (task 9): tally + assign < 0.5 ms game thread @ 1k in contact;
-	// baseline JSON checked in, CI compares.
-	AddError(TEXT("skeleton: perf gate lands with task 9"));
-	return false;
-}
-
 
 
